older for about content, will be filled by about.html but we can keep as is -->\n        <h2>About Me</h2>\n        <p>Dr. Lydia Moreno is an associate professor of Computational Neuroscience at Riverbend University’s School of Biological Sciences. Her work sits at the intersection of machine learning, systems neuroscience, and bioinformatics, aiming to unravel how neural circuits encode and process complex sensory information. She received her Ph.D. in Computational Biology from Baywood Institute of Technology and completed postdoctoral training in high-throughput imaging analysis at Northborough Research Center.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class="section" id="blog">  <!-- placeholder for blog content, will be filled by blog.html -->\n        <h2>Blog</h2>\n        <p>Check out my latest posts:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li><a href="#">March 2025: Building Interpretable Deep Learning Models for Neuroscience</a></li>\n            <li><a href="#">January 2025: Bridging Machine Learning and Single-Cell Genomics</a></li>\n            <li><a href="#">November 2024: Scaling Graph Neural Networks for Connectomics</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class="section" id="teaching">  <!-- placeholder for teaching content, will be filled by about.html but we can keep as is -->\n        <h2>Teaching & Mentorship</h2>\n        <p>See <a href="index.html">Home</a> for details.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class="section" id="skills">  <!-- placeholder for skills content, will be filled by about.html but we can keep as is -->\n        <h2>Skills & Tools</h2>\n        <p>See <a href="index.html">Home</a> for details.</n>\n    </div>\n    <div class="section" id="contact">  <!-- placeholder for contact content, will be filled by about.html but we can keep as is -->\n        <h2>Contact</h2>\n        <p>See <a href="index.html">Home</a> for details.</p>\n    </div>\n    <footer>\n        <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:lydia.moreno@riverbend.edu">lydia.moreno@riverbend.edu</a> 